SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 23 - Some Roads Lead to Fortune. Ours
 Usually Lead to Gunfire
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan rides again as our Red Dead Redemption II
 adventure continues. Somewhere out there must be a peaceful road leading
 to prosperity and a comfortable retirement. Unfortunately, we seem to have
 an extraordinary talent for finding the ones that lead directly into
 trouble, gunfire, and somebody shouting about the law. Arthur Morgan and
 the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and
 bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight
 their way across the rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i1_u1nusNHI
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
