SUMMARY: Phasmophobia | Ep. 20 - Halloween Special: Knocking on Doors We
 Really Shouldn't
DESCRIPTION:HallowStream Week begins with a return to Phasmophobia! We're
 heading into haunted locations, investigating paranormal activity, and
 attempting to identify whatever is lurking in the darkness. Naturally,
 this involves walking into buildings that have absolutely no business
 being entered after sunset. If something whispers my name, I'm leaving.
 Grab your ghost-hunting equipment and prepare for a terrifying night of
 paranormal investigation in Phasmophobia! We'll be exploring haunted
 houses, abandoned buildings and other creepy locations as we attempt to
 identify the spirits lurking within. Armed with EMF readers, spirit boxes,
 thermometers, UV lights and plenty of questionable courage, we'll gather
 evidence, investigate ghostly activity and hopefully escape before things
 turn deadly. Whether we're hunting ghosts alone or teaming up with
 friends, expect plenty of jump scares, unexpected encounters, hilarious
 moments and probably a lot of screaming. Can we uncover the truth behind
 each haunting, or will the ghosts get the last laugh?
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E-L7SDwBcwY
CATEGORIES:Phasmophobia
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24952211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261006T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T205300Z
DTSTART:20261027T213000Z
DTEND:20261027T233000Z
SUMMARY: Halloween Black Witch 300 Piece Jigsaw Puzzles - Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Tonight we're taking a slightly different approach to
 Halloween horror with a spooky 300-piece Black Witch jigsaw puzzle! Join
 me for a relaxed evening of puzzling, chatting, and attempting to work out
 where all those suspiciously similar pieces belong. Three hundred pieces.
 One witch. And absolutely no guarantee that I won't spend twenty minutes
 looking for a corner piece that's already on the table. Relax and chat
 with a cosy Jigsaw Puzzle Night. Settle in for a cosy puzzle-building
 stream as we tackle a 300-piece Halloween jigsaw puzzle together on
 camera! This time we're piecing together a wonderfully autumnal scene
 featuring a witch and her black cat wandering through a glowing woodland
 filled with falling leaves and pumpkins, complete with the message \"Once
 upon a time there was a girl who really loved cats and Halloween.\" We'll
 sort the pieces, hunt for those elusive matches, chat along the way and
 slowly bring this colourful Halloween scene to life. No rush, no
 pressure-just a chilled-out puzzle session, plenty of conversation and
 hopefully the satisfaction of placing that final piece!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BCQR8AcoUGE
CATEGORIES:Jigsaw Puzzle
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
