SUMMARY: Halloween Black Witch 300 Piece Jigsaw Puzzles - Part 2
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back into the eldritch nightmare of Edge Of
 Evil, and this time our priorities are perfectly clear. We're here for
 Mittens. That's it. Ancient horrors, supernatural entities, and whatever
 unspeakable evil is lurking nearby can sort themselves out. Nobody is
 leaving without the cat. Relax and chat with a cosy Jigsaw Puzzle Night.
 Settle in for a cosy puzzle-building stream as we tackle a 300-piece
 Halloween jigsaw puzzle together on camera! This time we're piecing
 together a wonderfully autumnal scene featuring a witch and her black cat
 wandering through a glowing woodland filled with falling leaves and
 pumpkins, complete with the message \"Once upon a time there was a girl
 who really loved cats and Halloween.\" We'll sort the pieces, hunt for
 those elusive matches, chat along the way and slowly bring this colourful
 Halloween scene to life. No rush, no pressure-just a chilled-out puzzle
 session, plenty of conversation and hopefully the satisfaction of placing
 that final piece!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z7sbDCW_djA
CATEGORIES:Jigsaw Puzzle
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
