UID:stream-24982211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261009T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T205300Z
DTSTART:20261030T213000Z
DTEND:20261030T233000Z
SUMMARY: Edge Of Evil | Ep. 3 - I've Come for Mittens. The Rest of You Can
 Stay Dead
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back aboard the Nostromo, where the atmosphere
 is tense, the corridors are dark, and somebody has apparently made an
 absolutely dreadful mess with the acid blood. Between the alien threat and
 the increasingly questionable working conditions, I'm beginning to think
 the crew should have negotiated a much better employment contract. Descend
 into a dark psychological horror adventure where the search for a lost
 kitten leads deep into an ancient pirate crypt. Explore hidden passages,
 disturb forgotten graves, solve cryptic puzzles, dig for clues and
 treasure, and defend yourself from undead shadow creatures lurking below.
 With an eerie atmosphere, immersive sound, fully voiced characters and a
 mystery surrounding a broken ancient seal, this is a journey where
 curiosity may take us far deeper than we ever intended.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Edge Of Evil
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24992211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261010T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T205300Z
DTSTART:20261031T213000Z
DTEND:20261031T233000Z
SUMMARY: The Lightkeeper | Long Play - I Came Here to Forget. Something
 Here Remembers
DESCRIPTION:It's Halloween night, and we're celebrating with a special
 long play of The Lightkeeper. An isolated lighthouse, unsettling
 mysteries, and the uncomfortable feeling that something from the past
 refuses to stay buried. Join me for an atmospheric evening of
 psychological horror, exploration, and the creeping suspicion that coming
 here was an absolutely terrible idea. Step into the isolated life of
 Arthur, a World War I veteran who takes a job as a lighthouse keeper on a
 remote island in 1925. What begins as a seemingly peaceful escape soon
 descends into psychological horror as we maintain the lighthouse, manage
 essential supplies and explore the island while uncovering the disturbing
 truth behind the deaths of its previous keepers. With haunting
 surroundings, unsettling mysteries and multiple endings shaped by our
 choices, we'll have to discover what is real-and what may be waiting for
 us in the darkness.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Lightkeeper
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
