SUMMARY: Movie Night | Ep. 88 - Zombieland (2009)
DESCRIPTION:After a full week of haunted houses, witches, eldritch
 horrors, vampires, aliens, and unsettling lighthouses, we're finishing
 HallowStream with the perfect dose of zombie-filled comedy horror. Grab
 your snacks, remember the rules, and join the community for Zombieland
 (2009). Cardio might be important, but so is having something decent to
 eat during the film. Meet you all on Discord for Movie Night.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Movie Night
