SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 4 - Saving
 Cyrodiil Between Unnecessary Side Quests
DESCRIPTION: Return to the province of Cyrodiil in a remastered version of
 the legendary open-world RPG. With the Emperor slain and mysterious
 Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll create our character,
 explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests, join factions, delve into
 dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes Dagon. Whether we
 follow the main story or get completely distracted by side quests, there's
 a huge fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
