SUMMARY:Comic-Con | Ep. 1 - Comic Con Ireland
DESCRIPTION: A special IRL trip to Comic-Con Ireland for a weekend
 celebrating movies, television, comics and pop culture. I'll be heading
 along to enjoy the convention and meet some incredible guests, including
 William Shatner, Elijah Wood, Sean Astin, Miranda Otto and Steve
 Guttenberg. There won't be a live stream from the event, but expect plenty
 of stories and memories from the trip!
